#: ../../../topics/signals.rst:161
msgid ""
"Only wait for this signal from :meth:`~scrapy.Spider.start`. While no "
"request can be sent, e.g. while the responses being parsed exceed :setting:"
"`SCRAPER_SLOT_MAX_ACTIVE_SIZE`, the engine does not ask the scheduler for "
"requests, and hence this signal is not sent. So waiting for it from a :ref:"
"`callback <callbacks>` can hang the crawl, because the response being parsed "
"is itself one of the responses that may be blocking requests."
msgstr ""

